[["Map",1,2,9,10],"meta::meta",["Map",3,4,5,6,7,8],"astro-version","5.18.2","astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"site\":\"https://blog.28453677.xyz\",\"compressHTML\":true,\"base\":\"/\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"entry.mjs\",\"redirects\":true,\"inlineStylesheets\":\"auto\",\"concurrency\":1},\"server\":{\"open\":false,\"host\":false,\"port\":4321,\"streaming\":true,\"allowedHosts\":[]},\"redirects\":{},\"image\":{\"endpoint\":{\"route\":\"/_image\"},\"service\":{\"entrypoint\":\"astro/assets/services/sharp\",\"config\":{}},\"domains\":[],\"remotePatterns\":[],\"responsiveStyles\":false},\"devToolbar\":{\"enabled\":true},\"markdown\":{\"syntaxHighlight\":{\"type\":\"shiki\",\"excludeLangs\":[\"math\"]},\"shikiConfig\":{\"langs\":[],\"langAlias\":{},\"theme\":\"github-dark\",\"themes\":{},\"wrap\":true,\"transformers\":[]},\"remarkPlugins\":[],\"rehypePlugins\":[],\"remarkRehype\":{},\"gfm\":true,\"smartypants\":true},\"security\":{\"checkOrigin\":true,\"allowedDomains\":[],\"actionBodySizeLimit\":1048576},\"env\":{\"schema\":{},\"validateSecrets\":false},\"experimental\":{\"clientPrerender\":false,\"contentIntellisense\":false,\"headingIdCompat\":false,\"preserveScriptOrder\":false,\"liveContentCollections\":false,\"csp\":false,\"staticImportMetaEnv\":false,\"chromeDevtoolsWorkspace\":false,\"failOnPrerenderConflict\":false,\"svgo\":false},\"legacy\":{\"collections\":false}}","content-config-digest","d8a39cbac071d373","blog",["Map",11,12,52,53,93,94],"git-best-practices",{"id":11,"data":13,"body":21,"filePath":22,"digest":23,"rendered":24,"legacyId":51},{"title":14,"description":15,"pubDate":16,"category":17,"tags":18},"Git 版本控制最佳实践","分享团队协作中 Git 的使用规范，包括分支策略、commit 规范、code review 流程等。","2024-10-22","开发工具",[19,20],"Git","版本控制","## 分支策略\n\n推荐使用 **Git Flow** 或 **GitHub Flow** 作为团队的分支管理策略。\n\n### Git Flow\n\n- `main`: 生产环境分支\n- `develop`: 开发主分支\n- `feature/*`: 功能分支\n- `release/*`: 发布分支\n- `hotfix/*`: 紧急修复分支\n\n### GitHub Flow\n\n更简单的模型：\n\n- `main`: 始终可部署\n- `feature/*`: 所有开发在特性分支进行\n- 通过 Pull Request 合并到 main\n\n## Commit 规范\n\n推荐使用 **Conventional Commits** 格式：\n\n```\n\u003Ctype>(\u003Cscope>): \u003Cdescription>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer]\n```\n\n类型（type）包括：\n- `feat`: 新功能\n- `fix`: 修复 bug\n- `docs`: 文档更新\n- `style`: 代码格式调整\n- `refactor`: 重构\n- `test`: 测试相关\n- `chore`: 构建/工具相关\n\n### 示例\n\n```\nfeat(auth): add JWT authentication\n\n- Add JWT token generation\n- Add middleware for token verification\n- Add refresh token logic\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n## Code Review 流程\n\n1. 创建 Pull Request\n2. 请求至少一位 reviewer\n3. 通过 CI 检查\n4. 解决所有 review 意见\n5. 合并到目标分支\n\n## 总结\n\n规范的 Git 使用是高效团队协作的基础。选择合适的策略并坚持执行，能大幅减少合并冲突和沟通成本。","src/content/blog/git-best-practices.md","0039c978d96bc856",{"html":25,"metadata":26},"\u003Ch2 id=\"分支策略\">分支策略\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>推荐使用 \u003Cstrong>Git Flow\u003C/strong> 或 \u003Cstrong>GitHub Flow\u003C/strong> 作为团队的分支管理策略。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"git-flow\">Git Flow\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>main\u003C/code>: 生产环境分支\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>develop\u003C/code>: 开发主分支\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>feature/*\u003C/code>: 功能分支\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>release/*\u003C/code>: 发布分支\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>hotfix/*\u003C/code>: 紧急修复分支\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"github-flow\">GitHub Flow\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>更简单的模型：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>main\u003C/code>: 始终可部署\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>feature/*\u003C/code>: 所有开发在特性分支进行\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>通过 Pull Request 合并到 main\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"commit-规范\">Commit 规范\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>推荐使用 \u003Cstrong>Conventional Commits\u003C/strong> 格式：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>&#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;description>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>[optional body]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>[optional footer]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>类型（type）包括：\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>feat\u003C/code>: 新功能\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>fix\u003C/code>: 修复 bug\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>docs\u003C/code>: 文档更新\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>style\u003C/code>: 代码格式调整\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>refactor\u003C/code>: 重构\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>test\u003C/code>: 测试相关\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>chore\u003C/code>: 构建/工具相关\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"示例\">示例\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>feat(auth): add JWT authentication\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>- Add JWT token generation\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>- Add middleware for token verification\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>- Add refresh token logic\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>Closes #123\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"code-review-流程\">Code Review 流程\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>创建 Pull Request\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>请求至少一位 reviewer\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>通过 CI 检查\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>解决所有 review 意见\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>合并到目标分支\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>规范的 Git 使用是高效团队协作的基础。选择合适的策略并坚持执行，能大幅减少合并冲突和沟通成本。\u003C/p>",{"headings":27,"localImagePaths":48,"remoteImagePaths":49,"frontmatter":13,"imagePaths":50},[28,31,35,38,41,43,46],{"depth":29,"slug":30,"text":30},2,"分支策略",{"depth":32,"slug":33,"text":34},3,"git-flow","Git Flow",{"depth":32,"slug":36,"text":37},"github-flow","GitHub Flow",{"depth":29,"slug":39,"text":40},"commit-规范","Commit 规范",{"depth":32,"slug":42,"text":42},"示例",{"depth":29,"slug":44,"text":45},"code-review-流程","Code Review 流程",{"depth":29,"slug":47,"text":47},"总结",[],[],[],"git-best-practices.md","docker-dev-env",{"id":52,"data":54,"body":62,"filePath":63,"digest":64,"rendered":65,"legacyId":92},{"title":55,"description":56,"pubDate":57,"category":17,"tags":58},"使用 Docker 构建高效开发环境","详细介绍如何使用 Docker 和 Docker Compose 搭建本地开发环境，包括多服务编排、网络配置和数据持久化。","2024-12-15",[59,60,61],"Docker","容器","开发环境","## 为什么选择 Docker？\n\nDocker 已经成为现代开发工作流中不可或缺的工具。它通过容器化技术，让开发环境的一致性和可复现性大大提升。\n\n### 核心优势\n\n1. **环境一致性**：无论在 Windows、macOS 还是 Linux 上，Docker 容器内的环境完全一致\n2. **快速部署**：通过 `docker-compose up` 一条命令即可启动完整的开发环境\n3. **资源隔离**：每个服务运行在独立的容器中，互不干扰\n4. **易于分享**：通过 Dockerfile 和 docker-compose.yml 即可分享完整环境配置\n\n## 实战：搭建开发环境\n\n### 1. 创建 docker-compose.yml\n\n```yaml\nversion: '3.8'\nservices:\n  postgres:\n    image: postgres:16-alpine\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_DB: myapp\n      POSTGRES_USER: dev\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: dev123\n    ports:\n      - '5432:5432'\n    volumes:\n      - pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    ports:\n      - '6379:6379'\n\n  app:\n    build: .\n    ports:\n      - '3000:3000'\n    volumes:\n      - .:/app\n    depends_on:\n      - postgres\n      - redis\n\nvolumes:\n  pgdata:\n```\n\n### 2. 创建 Dockerfile\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:20-alpine\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\nCOPY . .\nCMD [\"npm\", \"run\", \"dev\"]\n```\n\n### 3. 启动环境\n\n```bash\ndocker-compose up -d\n```\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n- 使用 `.dockerignore` 排除不需要的文件\n- 合理使用多阶段构建减小镜像体积\n- 生产环境使用非 root 用户运行应用\n- 定期更新基础镜像以修复安全漏洞\n\n## 总结\n\nDocker 让开发环境的搭建变得简单高效。通过合理的配置，你可以在一分钟内启动包含数据库、缓存、应用服务在内的完整开发环境。","src/content/blog/docker-dev-env.md","f13f3cd020069cf3",{"html":66,"metadata":67},"\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么选择-docker\">为什么选择 Docker？\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Docker 已经成为现代开发工作流中不可或缺的工具。它通过容器化技术，让开发环境的一致性和可复现性大大提升。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"核心优势\">核心优势\u003C/h3>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>环境一致性\u003C/strong>：无论在 Windows、macOS 还是 Linux 上，Docker 容器内的环境完全一致\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>快速部署\u003C/strong>：通过 \u003Ccode>docker-compose up\u003C/code> 一条命令即可启动完整的开发环境\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>资源隔离\u003C/strong>：每个服务运行在独立的容器中，互不干扰\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>易于分享\u003C/strong>：通过 Dockerfile 和 docker-compose.yml 即可分享完整环境配置\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"实战搭建开发环境\">实战：搭建开发环境\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"1-创建-docker-composeyml\">1. 创建 docker-compose.yml\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"yaml\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">version\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">services\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  postgres\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    image\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    environment\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_DB\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">myapp\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_USER\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">dev\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_PASSWORD\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">dev123\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    ports\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'5432:5432'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    volumes\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  redis\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    image\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">redis:7-alpine\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    ports\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'6379:6379'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  app\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    build\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    ports\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'3000:3000'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    volumes\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">.:/app\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">    depends_on\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">postgres\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      - \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">redis\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">volumes\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#85E89D\">  pgdata\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"2-创建-dockerfile\">2. 创建 Dockerfile\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"dockerfile\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">FROM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> node:20-alpine\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">WORKDIR\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> /app\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">COPY\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> package*.json ./\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">RUN\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> npm install\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">COPY\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> . .\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">CMD\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"npm\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"run\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"dev\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"3-启动环境\">3. 启动环境\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">docker-compose\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> up\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -d\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>.dockerignore\u003C/code> 排除不需要的文件\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>合理使用多阶段构建减小镜像体积\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>生产环境使用非 root 用户运行应用\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>定期更新基础镜像以修复安全漏洞\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Docker 让开发环境的搭建变得简单高效。通过合理的配置，你可以在一分钟内启动包含数据库、缓存、应用服务在内的完整开发环境。\u003C/p>",{"headings":68,"localImagePaths":89,"remoteImagePaths":90,"frontmatter":54,"imagePaths":91},[69,72,74,77,80,83,86,88],{"depth":29,"slug":70,"text":71},"为什么选择-docker","为什么选择 Docker？",{"depth":32,"slug":73,"text":73},"核心优势",{"depth":29,"slug":75,"text":76},"实战搭建开发环境","实战：搭建开发环境",{"depth":32,"slug":78,"text":79},"1-创建-docker-composeyml","1. 创建 docker-compose.yml",{"depth":32,"slug":81,"text":82},"2-创建-dockerfile","2. 创建 Dockerfile",{"depth":32,"slug":84,"text":85},"3-启动环境","3. 启动环境",{"depth":29,"slug":87,"text":87},"最佳实践",{"depth":29,"slug":47,"text":47},[],[],[],"docker-dev-env.md","opencv-basics",{"id":93,"data":95,"body":104,"filePath":105,"digest":106,"rendered":107,"legacyId":132},{"title":96,"description":97,"pubDate":98,"category":99,"tags":100},"Python 图像处理入门：OpenCV 基础教程","从零开始学习 OpenCV，掌握图像读取、颜色空间转换、滤波和边缘检测等基础操作。","2024-11-28","学习笔记",[101,102,103],"Python","OpenCV","图像处理","## 什么是 OpenCV？\n\nOpenCV（Open Source Computer Vision Library）是一个开源的计算机视觉库，包含了数百种图像处理和计算机视觉算法。\n\n## 安装\n\n```bash\npip install opencv-python\n```\n\n## 基础操作\n\n### 读取和显示图像\n\n```python\nimport cv2\n\n# 读取图像\nimg = cv2.imread('image.jpg')\n\n# 显示图像\ncv2.imshow('Image', img)\ncv2.waitKey(0)\ncv2.destroyAllWindows()\n```\n\n### 颜色空间转换\n\n```python\n# BGR 转灰度\ngray = cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\n\n# BGR 转 HSV\nhsv = cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2HSV)\n```\n\n### 图像滤波\n\n```python\n# 高斯模糊\nblurred = cv2.GaussianBlur(img, (5, 5), 0)\n\n# 中值滤波\nmedian = cv2.medianBlur(img, 5)\n```\n\n### 边缘检测\n\n```python\n# Canny 边缘检测\nedges = cv2.Canny(gray, 100, 200)\n```\n\n## 实用技巧\n\n1. 使用 `cv2.resize()` 调整图像大小\n2. 使用 `cv2.rotate()` 旋转图像\n3. 使用 `cv2.flip()` 翻转图像\n\n## 总结\n\nOpenCV 功能强大，本文只介绍了最基础的操作。后续我们将深入探讨更多高级应用。","src/content/blog/opencv-basics.md","2f9ce7002d41b5a3",{"html":108,"metadata":109},"\u003Ch2 id=\"什么是-opencv\">什么是 OpenCV？\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>OpenCV（Open Source Computer Vision Library）是一个开源的计算机视觉库，包含了数百种图像处理和计算机视觉算法。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"安装\">安装\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">pip\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> install\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> opencv-python\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"基础操作\">基础操作\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"读取和显示图像\">读取和显示图像\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 读取图像\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">img \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.imread(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'image.jpg'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 显示图像\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">cv2.imshow(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'Image'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, img)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">cv2.waitKey(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">cv2.destroyAllWindows()\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"颜色空间转换\">颜色空间转换\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># BGR 转灰度\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">gray \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">COLOR_BGR2GRAY\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># BGR 转 HSV\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">hsv \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">COLOR_BGR2HSV\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"图像滤波\">图像滤波\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 高斯模糊\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">blurred \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.GaussianBlur(img, (\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">), \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 中值滤波\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">median \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.medianBlur(img, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"边缘检测\">边缘检测\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#6A737D\"># Canny 边缘检测\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">edges \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> cv2.Canny(gray, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">100\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">200\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"实用技巧\">实用技巧\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>cv2.resize()\u003C/code> 调整图像大小\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>cv2.rotate()\u003C/code> 旋转图像\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>cv2.flip()\u003C/code> 翻转图像\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>OpenCV 功能强大，本文只介绍了最基础的操作。后续我们将深入探讨更多高级应用。\u003C/p>",{"headings":110,"localImagePaths":129,"remoteImagePaths":130,"frontmatter":95,"imagePaths":131},[111,114,116,118,120,122,124,126,128],{"depth":29,"slug":112,"text":113},"什么是-opencv","什么是 OpenCV？",{"depth":29,"slug":115,"text":115},"安装",{"depth":29,"slug":117,"text":117},"基础操作",{"depth":32,"slug":119,"text":119},"读取和显示图像",{"depth":32,"slug":121,"text":121},"颜色空间转换",{"depth":32,"slug":123,"text":123},"图像滤波",{"depth":32,"slug":125,"text":125},"边缘检测",{"depth":29,"slug":127,"text